{"version":1,"caseId":"holdout-tide-post","split":"holdout","source":{"text":"海堤上的信箱进了沙。祁雨把铜钥匙递给莫舟，说：“先开右边那格。”莫舟没有伸手，反问：“你确定里面没有蟹？”\n祁雨笑了：“蟹可不会贴邮票。”莫舟这才接过钥匙。空信箱里滚出一枚贝壳，谁也没再说话。","sha256":"eebde83342adbbd94be96db07d5df362a6cae598739db587648ecc924a213797"},"characters":[{"id":"c-qiyu","name":"祁雨"},{"id":"c-mozhou","name":"莫舟"}],"annotation":{"origin":"original-public-synthetic-AI-authored-2026-11-08","reviewStatus":"AI-author-unit-checked-not-independent-human-ground-truth"},"gold":[{"id":"u1","start":0,"end":69,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u2","start":69,"end":96,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-qiyu"]},{"id":"u3","start":96,"end":126,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u4","start":126,"end":159,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-mozhou"]},{"id":"u5","start":159,"end":175,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u6","start":175,"end":205,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-qiyu"]},{"id":"u7","start":205,"end":286,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]}],"reviewInput":{"segments":[{"start":0,"end":69,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":0,"end":69}]},{"start":69,"end":96,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-mozhou","evidence":[{"start":69,"end":96}]},{"start":96,"end":126,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":96,"end":126}]},{"start":126,"end":159,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-qiyu","evidence":[{"start":126,"end":159}]},{"start":159,"end":175,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":159,"end":175}]},{"start":175,"end":205,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-qiyu","evidence":[{"start":175,"end":205}]},{"start":205,"end":286,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":205,"end":286}]}]},"reviewGold":{"issues":[{"id":"planted-2","start":69,"end":96,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-qiyu"]},{"id":"planted-4","start":126,"end":159,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-mozhou"]}]}}
{"version":1,"caseId":"holdout-dark-stair","split":"holdout","source":{"text":"停电后，叶槿独自守着楼梯口。隔着锁住的铁门，一个身份不明的陌生人喊：“有人带手电吗？”叶槿朝门外答道：“有，你先别走动。”门外那人又说：“我就在原地。”\n灯恢复时，门外已经空了；叶槿始终没有看见那人的脸，也不知道姓名。","sha256":"e9366d8dcc1f8fb3719af7a8ce19b5ea61b9766bfaba40e3c30676ef34e64e97"},"characters":[{"id":"c-yejin","name":"叶槿"}],"annotation":{"origin":"original-public-synthetic-AI-authored-2026-11-08","reviewStatus":"AI-author-unit-checked-not-independent-human-ground-truth"},"gold":[{"id":"u1","start":0,"end":102,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u2","start":102,"end":129,"kind":"speech","speakers":["unknown"]},{"id":"u3","start":129,"end":153,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u4","start":153,"end":183,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-yejin"]},{"id":"u5","start":183,"end":204,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u6","start":204,"end":228,"kind":"speech","speakers":["unknown"]},{"id":"u7","start":228,"end":325,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]}],"reviewInput":{"segments":[{"start":0,"end":102,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":0,"end":102}]},{"start":102,"end":129,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-yejin","evidence":[{"start":102,"end":129}]},{"start":129,"end":153,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":129,"end":153}]},{"start":153,"end":183,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-yejin","evidence":[{"start":153,"end":183}]},{"start":183,"end":204,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":183,"end":204}]},{"start":204,"end":228,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":204,"end":228}]},{"start":228,"end":325,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":228,"end":325}]}]},"reviewGold":{"issues":[{"id":"planted-2","start":102,"end":129,"kind":"speech","speakers":["unknown"]},{"id":"planted-6","start":204,"end":228,"kind":"speech","speakers":["unknown"]}]}}
{"version":1,"caseId":"holdout-two-lu","split":"holdout","source":{"text":"北街木匠陆青和南街医师陆青在渡口碰面。佩木制名牌的木匠先开口：“我来修船板。”佩白瓷名牌的医师放下药箱，说：“我来给船工换药。”木匠陆青指着自己的木名牌补了一句：“别把我的账记到他名下。”医师陆青点点头，把两张收据分别压在药箱和工具袋下。","sha256":"546263cc144e12bbb5c075063d65742a6003800c789ea41d85baefedb5f242f6"},"characters":[{"id":"c-lu-carpenter","name":"陆青","description":"北街木匠，佩木制名牌"},{"id":"c-lu-medic","name":"陆青","description":"南街医师，佩白瓷名牌"}],"annotation":{"origin":"original-public-synthetic-AI-authored-2026-11-08","reviewStatus":"AI-author-unit-checked-not-independent-human-ground-truth"},"gold":[{"id":"u1","start":0,"end":93,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u2","start":93,"end":117,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-lu-carpenter"]},{"id":"u3","start":117,"end":162,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u4","start":162,"end":192,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-lu-medic"]},{"id":"u5","start":192,"end":243,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u6","start":243,"end":282,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-lu-carpenter"]},{"id":"u7","start":282,"end":357,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]}],"reviewInput":{"segments":[{"start":0,"end":93,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":0,"end":93}]},{"start":93,"end":117,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-lu-medic","evidence":[{"start":93,"end":117}]},{"start":117,"end":162,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":117,"end":162}]},{"start":162,"end":192,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-lu-carpenter","evidence":[{"start":162,"end":192}]},{"start":192,"end":243,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":192,"end":243}]},{"start":243,"end":282,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-lu-carpenter","evidence":[{"start":243,"end":282}]},{"start":282,"end":357,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":282,"end":357}]}]},"reviewGold":{"issues":[{"id":"planted-2","start":93,"end":117,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-lu-carpenter"]},{"id":"planted-4","start":162,"end":192,"kind":"