{"version":1,"caseId":"holdout-title-in-quote","split":"holdout","source":{"text":"宁舒把修好的钟摆交给冯伯。冯伯只是接过，没有说话。宁舒对他说：“他们叫你‘守钟人’，可我觉得‘补星星的人’更贴切。”冯伯听完才回答：“‘补星星的人’这个称号太大，我只会拧螺丝。”宁舒指着表盘接话：“那就先把这颗‘星星’拧紧。”\n两人抬头，看见秒针越过了裂纹。","sha256":"e50e48bf45c693a7fac5fa25468ea4a51e80b82cd43e04caa071216da5605979"},"characters":[{"id":"c-ningshu","name":"宁舒"},{"id":"c-laofeng","name":"冯伯","aliases":["守钟人"]}],"annotation":{"origin":"original-public-synthetic-AI-authored-2026-11-08","reviewStatus":"AI-author-unit-checked-not-independent-human-ground-truth"},"gold":[{"id":"u1","start":0,"end":93,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u2","start":93,"end":174,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-ningshu"]},{"id":"u3","start":174,"end":198,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u4","start":198,"end":267,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-laofeng"]},{"id":"u5","start":267,"end":294,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u6","start":294,"end":339,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-ningshu"]},{"id":"u7","start":339,"end":385,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]}],"reviewInput":{"segments":[{"start":0,"end":93,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":0,"end":93}]},{"start":93,"end":174,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-laofeng","evidence":[{"start":93,"end":174}]},{"start":174,"end":198,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":174,"end":198}]},{"start":198,"end":267,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":198,"end":267}]},{"start":267,"end":294,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":267,"end":294}]},{"start":294,"end":339,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-ningshu","evidence":[{"start":294,"end":339}]},{"start":339,"end":385,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":339,"end":385}]}]},"reviewGold":{"issues":[{"id":"planted-2","start":93,"end":174,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-ningshu"]},{"id":"planted-4","start":198,"end":267,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-laofeng"]}]}}
{"version":1,"caseId":"holdout-unspoken-seed","split":"holdout","source":{"text":"程栗看着闻禾掌心最后一粒种子，心想：“要是还不发芽，他会不会灰心？”这句话她没有说出口。闻禾并不知道她的念头，只轻声问：“窗边的位置还空着吗？”程栗点头，回答：“留着呢。”闻禾把种子放进土里，暗自想道：“明天再冷，我也要来看它。”\n屋里只剩浇水的细响。","sha256":"03e61ce761a940cd5fa638176dd2895fd406d962ed04bfc99428d70c776d0d72"},"characters":[{"id":"c-chengli","name":"程栗"},{"id":"c-wenhe","name":"闻禾"}],"annotation":{"origin":"original-public-synthetic-AI-authored-2026-11-08","reviewStatus":"AI-author-unit-checked-not-independent-human-ground-truth"},"gold":[{"id":"u1","start":0,"end":54,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u2","start":54,"end":102,"kind":"thought","speakers":["c-chengli"]},{"id":"u3","start":102,"end":180,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u4","start":180,"end":216,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-wenhe"]},{"id":"u5","start":216,"end":240,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u6","start":240,"end":258,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-chengli"]},{"id":"u7","start":258,"end":303,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u8","start":303,"end":345,"kind":"thought","speakers":["c-wenhe"]},{"id":"u9","start":345,"end":376,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]}],"reviewInput":{"segments":[{"start":0,"end":54,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":0,"end":54}]},{"start":54,"end":102,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-chengli","evidence":[{"start":54,"end":102}]},{"start":102,"end":180,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":102,"end":180}]},{"start":180,"end":216,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-wenhe","evidence":[{"start":180,"end":216}]},{"start":216,"end":240,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":216,"end":240}]},{"start":240,"end":258,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-chengli","evidence":[{"start":240,"end":258}]},{"start":258,"end":303,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":258,"end":303}]},{"start":303,"end":345,"kind":"thought","speaker":"c-chengli","evidence":[{"start