{"version":1,"caseId":"holdout-glass-unicode","split":"holdout","source":{"text":"赵柠在无人展柜前停下。玻璃上印着“请勿触摸”，旁边的电子屏静默显示「月相：🌘」。\r\n屏幕下一行是组合字符“é”和汉字“𠮷”；这些都是文字，没有广播。\t赵柠低声念给自己听：“这个字读吉，标记是🧭。”\n她没有念出告示。屏幕把“0”换成了“１”，仍未发声。赵柠心里想：“原来我看漏了一笔。”\n她拿出本子，画了一条短横线。\n","sha256":"6b9b5a91de8edf661961fee93e2849189160b6a7017ae6d137114605098c1ee8"},"characters":[{"id":"c-zhaoning","name":"赵柠"}],"annotation":{"origin":"original-public-synthetic-AI-authored-2026-11-08","reviewStatus":"AI-author-unit-checked-not-independent-human-ground-truth"},"gold":[{"id":"u1","start":0,"end":123,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u2","start":123,"end":221,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u3","start":221,"end":251,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u4","start":251,"end":291,"kind":"speech","speakers":["c-zhaoning"]},{"id":"u5","start":291,"end":368,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u6","start":368,"end":386,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]},{"id":"u7","start":386,"end":419,"kind":"thought","speakers":["c-zhaoning"]},{"id":"u8","start":419,"end":463,"kind":"narration","speakers":["narrator"]}],"reviewInput":{"segments":[{"start":0,"end":123,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-zhaoning","evidence":[{"start":0,"end":123}]},{"start":123,"end":221,"kind":"speech","speaker":"unknown","evidence":[{"start":123,"end":221}]},{"start":221,"end":251,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":221,"end":251}]},{"start":251,"end":291,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-zhaoning","evidence":[{"start":251,"end":291}]},{"start":291,"end":368,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":291,"end":368}]},{"start":368,"end":386,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":368,"end":386}]},{"start":386,"end":419,"kind":"speech","speaker":"c-zhaoning","evidence":[{"start":386,"end":419}]},{"start":419,"end":463,"kind":"narration","speaker":"narrator","evidence":[{"start":419,"end":463}]}]},"reviewGold":{"issues":[{"id"